  artifactName: Mythical Bakunawa Dragon Figurine
  artifactSprite: {fileID: 3002304851019632288, guid: 29466b69b76ba8b4ba070e9cdd25b592, type: 3}
  plaqueTitle: Mythical Bakunawa Dragon Figurine
  plaqueDescription: A magnificent serpentine dragon sculpture depicting the Bakunawa,
    the legendary Philippine dragon believed to swallow the moon during lunar eclipses.
  artifactInspectionDescription: Intricately cast with undulating serpentine coils,
    prominent dorsal fins, and a crested draconic head. Subtle okir relief patterns
    adorn the circular mounting plinth.
